<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  Responsible AI Audit Report — Website-style layout

  This is a SINGLE-FILE, self-contained HTML report.
  - No external libraries, no fonts, no images, no internet required.
  - All data is embedded in the <script type="application/json"> block at the bottom.
  - All styling is inline in <style>.
  - All interactivity is in vanilla JS at the bottom.

  How the skill uses this template:
    1. Copy this file to <project>/rai-governance/reports/rai-audit-report-<agent>.html
    2. Replace the single placeholder {{AUDIT_DATA_JSON}} with the actual data blob.
    3. Done. The user double-clicks the file to open it.

  The data blob must match the shape used by the JS at the bottom (see render() functions).
-->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Responsible AI Audit Report — {{CODEBASE_NAME}}</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #0f172a;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* ── App layout: sidebar + main ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .app { display: flex; min-height: 100vh; }
  .sidebar {
    width: 280px; flex-shrink: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1628 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);
    color: #e2e8f0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100vh;
  }
  .brand {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .brand-title { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: white; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .brand-sub { font-size: 0.72rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-top: 0.2rem;
               text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }

  .nav { flex: 1; padding: 1rem 0.75rem; overflow-y: auto; }
  .nav a {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem; margin: 0.1rem 0; border-radius: 8px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.12s; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav a:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: white; }
  .nav a.active { background: rgba(37,99,235,0.25); color: white; }
  .nav a .ic { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: 0.85; }

  .sidebar-footer {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    font-size: 0.72rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .sidebar-footer .label { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
                           text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em; font-size: 0.62rem; }
  .sidebar-footer .value { color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 500; word-break: break-word; }
  .sidebar-footer p { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }

  .main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; padding: 2rem 2.5rem; max-width: 1180px; }

  /* ── Page sections (tabs) ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .page { display: none; animation: fadeIn 0.18s ease; }
  .page.active { display: block; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  .page-title { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
                margin-bottom: 0.25rem; color: #0f172a; }
  .page-subtitle { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; max-width: 75ch; }

  /* ── Cards & generic blocks ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .card {
    background: white; border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: #0f172a; }
  .card p { color: #334155; }
  .card .small { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; }

  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .grid-4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid-2, .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar { width: 220px; }
    .main { padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
  }

  /* ── Home page styles ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .pillar-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .pillar-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, white);
                 border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem; }
  .pillar-card h4 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: #1e293b; }
  .pillar-card .code { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb;
                       letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; display: block; }
  .pillar-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* ── Score / maturity card ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .score-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, auto) 1fr;
                gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
  .score-big { font-size: 4rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.04em;
               color: var(--maturity-color, #2563eb); }
  .score-label { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b;
                 text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .maturity-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 0.35rem 0.95rem;
                    border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700;
                    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
                    background: var(--maturity-bg); color: var(--maturity-color);
                    border: 1.5px solid var(--maturity-border); margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  .pillar-scores { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0.85rem; }
  .pillar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .pillar-row .name { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;
                      width: 180px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2; }
  .pillar-row .name .code { font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8;
                            letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-left: 0.3rem; }
  .pillar-row .bar-track { flex: 1; height: 8px; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 4px;
                           overflow: hidden; }
  .pillar-row .bar-fill { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px;
                          transition: width 0.4s, background 0.4s; }
  .pillar-row .bar-fill.advanced    { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #16a34a, #22c55e); }
  .pillar-row .bar-fill.established { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6); }
  .pillar-row .bar-fill.developing  { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d97706, #f59e0b); }
  .pillar-row .bar-fill.low         { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #dc2626, #ef4444); }
  .pillar-row .bar-fill.unscored    { background: #cbd5e1; }
  .pillar-row .pct { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;
                     width: 50px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .pillar-row .grade { font-size: 0.66rem; font-weight: 700;
                       text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
                       padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 999px;
                       width: 95px; text-align: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .pillar-row .grade.advanced    { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
  .pillar-row .grade.established { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
  .pillar-row .grade.developing  { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
  .pillar-row .grade.low         { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
  .pillar-row .grade.unscored    { background: #f1f5f9; color: #64748b; }

  /* ── Counts strip ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .counts-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 0.5rem;
                  background: white; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 12px;
                  margin-bottom: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04); }
  .count-cell { text-align: center; padding: 0.5rem; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
  .count-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .count-cell .n { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;
                   font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .count-cell .lbl { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;
                     text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-top: 0.3rem; }
  .count-cell.compliant .n { color: #16a34a; }
  .count-cell.partial .n { color: #d97706; }
  .count-cell.non_compliant .n, .count-cell.non-compliant .n { color: #dc2626; }
  .count-cell.unknown .n { color: #64748b; }
  .count-cell.needs_input .n { color: #6366f1; }
  .count-cell.disabled .n { color: #9ca3af; }

  /* ── Filter bar ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .filter-bar { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
                margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 0.85rem; background: white;
                border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04); }
  .filter-bar input[type=search] {
    flex: 1; min-width: 180px; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; outline: none;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .filter-bar input[type=search]:focus { border-color: #2563eb; }
  .chip { padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.78rem;
          font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.12s;
          border: 1.5px solid transparent; background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; }
  .chip:hover { background: #e2e8f0; }
  .chip.active { background: #1e3a8a; color: white; border-color: #1e3a8a; }
  .chip .ct { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-radius: 999px;
              padding: 0.05rem 0.45rem; margin-left: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.72rem; }
  .chip:not(.active) .ct { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.06); color: #475569; }
  .filter-bar select { padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                       border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; background: white;
                       font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }

  /* ── Findings & questionnaire items ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .item { background: white; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px;
          padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; transition: box-shadow 0.12s; }
  .item:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.08); }
  .item-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .item-head .id { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2563eb;
                   letter-spacing: 0.05em; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
                   background: #dbeafe; border-radius: 4px; }
  .item-head .name { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .pill { padding: 0.18rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.7rem;
          font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .pill.compliant     { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
  .pill.partial       { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
  .pill.non_compliant { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
  .pill.unknown       { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; }
  .pill.needs_input   { background: #ede9fe; color: #5b21b6; }
  .pill.disabled      { background: #e5e7eb; color: #6b7280; }
  .pill.auto_resolved { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
  .pill.deferred      { background: #fef9c3; color: #854d0e; }
  .pill.high          { background: #fecaca; color: #991b1b; }
  .pill.medium        { background: #fde68a; color: #92400e; }
  .pill.low           { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
  .item-body { margin-top: 0.85rem; padding-top: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
               display: grid; gap: 0.65rem; }
  .item-body .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr; gap: 0.85rem;
                    font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .item-body .label { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b;
                      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
                      padding-top: 0.1rem; }
  .item-body .value { color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.55; word-break: break-word; }
  .item-body .value code { font-family: "SF Mono","Fira Code",monospace; font-size: 0.82rem;
                            background: #f1f5f9; padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 3px; }
  details.expandable { cursor: pointer; }
  details.expandable summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; }
  details.expandable summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details.expandable summary::after { content: '▾'; margin-left: auto;
                                       color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.85rem;
                                       transition: transform 0.15s; }
  details.expandable[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(180deg); }

  /* ── Questionnaire blocks ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .block { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .block-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
                  padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .block-header .num { background: #1e3a8a; color: white;
                       width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 6px;
                       display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
                       font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .block-header h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; flex: 1; }
  .block-header .meta { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #64748b; }

  /* ── SVG trend chart ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .chart-wrap { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem;
                border: 1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04); }
  .chart { width: 100%; height: 280px; }
  .chart .axis { stroke: #e2e8f0; stroke-width: 1; }
  .chart .grid { stroke: #f1f5f9; stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .chart .line { fill: none; stroke: #2563eb; stroke-width: 2.5;
                 stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .chart .area { fill: rgba(37,99,235,0.08); }
  .chart .dot { fill: white; stroke: #2563eb; stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .chart .dot:hover { fill: #2563eb; }
  .chart text { font-family: inherit; fill: #64748b; font-size: 11px; }
  .trend-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .trend-table th, .trend-table td { padding: 0.55rem 0.65rem; text-align: left;
                                       border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
  .trend-table th { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b;
                    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .trend-table td { color: #1e293b; }
  .trend-table .delta-up   { color: #16a34a; font-weight: 700; }
  .trend-table .delta-down { color: #dc2626; font-weight: 700; }
  .trend-table .delta-zero { color: #94a3b8; }

  /* ── Pre-screen / config table ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .kv-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .kv-table th, .kv-table td { padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem; text-align: left;
                                border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .kv-table th { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b;
                 text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
                 background: #f8fafc; }
  .kv-table .yes { color: #16a34a; font-weight: 700; }
  .kv-table .no  { color: #94a3b8; }

  /* ── Customize page ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .next-step-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fed7aa 100%);
    border: 1px solid #fbbf24; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .next-step-card h4 { color: #78350f; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .next-step-card p { color: #78350f; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .next-step-card .quote { display: block; margin-top: 0.6rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
                            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); border-radius: 6px;
                            font-style: italic; color: #5b2604;
                            border-left: 3px solid #d97706; }
  .next-step-card code { font-family: "SF Mono","Fira Code",monospace; font-size: 0.85rem;
                          background: rgba(120,53,15,0.1); padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem;
                          border-radius: 3px; color: #5b2604; font-style: normal; }

  /* Empty state */
  .empty { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; color: #94a3b8; }
  .empty .icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.5; }
  .empty h4 { color: #475569; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }

  .pre-screen-context { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6;
                         padding: 0.85rem 1rem; background: #f8fafc;
                         border-left: 3px solid #2563eb; border-radius: 4px;
                         margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  .pre-screen-context strong { color: #1e293b; }

  ul.bullets { padding-left: 1.25rem; color: #334155; }
  ul.bullets li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <!-- ── SIDEBAR NAV ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-title">Responsible AI Audit Report</div>
      <div class="brand-sub">Well-Architected Responsible AI Lens</div>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav" id="nav">
      <a data-target="home" class="active">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 12 12 3l9 9"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/></svg>
        Home
      </a>
      <a data-target="config">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1-1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51-1 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33h.01a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82v.01a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/></svg>
        Configuration
      </a>
      <a data-target="results">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="10"/><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="16"/></svg>
        Overall Results
      </a>
      <a data-target="rules">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="15" y2="17"/></svg>
        Rules Evaluation
      </a>
      <a data-target="beyond">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        Beyond Code Evidence
      </a>
      <a data-target="trend">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg>
        Score Trend
      </a>
      <a data-target="customize">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
        Customize &amp; Rerun
      </a>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar-footer">
      <p><span class="label">Codebase</span><br><span class="value" id="footer-codebase">—</span></p>
      <p><span class="label">Audit Mode</span><br><span class="value" id="footer-agent">—</span></p>
      <p><span class="label">Generated</span><br><span class="value" id="footer-time">—</span></p>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- ── MAIN CONTENT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <main class="main">

    <!-- HOME ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="page active" id="page-home">
      <h1 class="page-title">Responsible AI Audit Report</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle" id="home-sub">A structured assessment against the AWS Well-Architected Responsible AI Lens.</p>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>What is the AWS Well-Architected Responsible AI Lens?</h3>
        <p>The AWS Well-Architected Responsible AI Lens defines 99 best practices across the AI/ML lifecycle — covering use case definition, design, evaluation, and operations. It exists to help teams build AI systems that are <strong>fair, safe, transparent, and under appropriate human control</strong> by design rather than as an afterthought.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.6rem;">This audit consolidates those 99 best practices into 24 actionable rules, assesses your codebase against them using LLM-driven evidence analysis, and surfaces gaps with priority and remediation guidance. <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/responsible-ai-lens/responsible-ai-lens.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the official Lens documentation →</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>The Four Responsible AI Pillars</h3>
        <div class="pillar-grid">
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="code">RAIUC</span>
            <h4>Use Case Definition</h4>
            <p>Verify AI is necessary, identify all stakeholders including affected groups, and obtain proper organizational approval before any AI feature is built.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="code">RAIDD</span>
            <h4>Design &amp; Development</h4>
            <p>Embed fairness, explainability, privacy, safety, controllability, and data governance into the design — not as afterthoughts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="code">RAIER</span>
            <h4>Evaluation &amp; Release</h4>
            <p>Plan structured pre-release reviews against the 8 official Responsible AI dimensions: fairness, explainability, privacy and security, safety, controllability, veracity and robustness, governance, and transparency. Make a documented go/no-go decision.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="code">RAIOP</span>
            <h4>Operations</h4>
            <p>Monitor performance and fairness drift. Plan for AI incidents. Set governance review cadence. Provide user feedback mechanisms and transparency.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>What this report contains</h3>
        <ul class="bullets">
          <li><strong>Configuration</strong> — the project profile, pre-screen answers, and assumptions that shaped this audit</li>
          <li><strong>Overall Results</strong> — weighted maturity score, pillar breakdown, and finding distribution</li>
          <li><strong>Rules Evaluation</strong> — code-evidence findings for all 24 rules with status, priority, and reasoning</li>
          <li><strong>Beyond Code Evidence</strong> — questionnaire responses for governance decisions that can't be verified from code alone</li>
          <li><strong>Score Trend</strong> — how the audit score has changed across runs as code, decisions, and policy evolved</li>
          <li><strong>Customize &amp; Rerun</strong> — how to adjust rule policy or re-run the audit</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="background: #fef3c7; border-color: #fbbf24;">
        <h3 style="color: #78350f;">Human-in-the-loop</h3>
        <p style="color: #78350f;">Verdicts in this report are produced by an LLM analyzing the evidence the AI coding assistant gathered. They're a starting point for human review — not a substitute for it. Treat any finding marked <code>partial</code>, <code>non_compliant</code>, or <code>unknown</code> as a question to investigate, not a final answer. The questionnaire section captures decisions that require human judgment by design.</p>
      </div>
